MockMyCam — vendored third-party component
==========================================

This directory contains VirtualCamera, the iOS-Simulator camera-injection
library used by MockMyCam.

Vendored from:
  baguette — https://github.com/tddworks/baguette
  (which in turn vendored it from asc-pro/SimCam)

License: Apache License 2.0 (see ./LICENSE in this directory).

The Objective-C sources under ./Sources are unmodified copies of the upstream
VirtualCamera sources. MockMyCam builds them via Scripts/build-dylib.sh (an
original build script, not the upstream build.sh) and bundles the resulting
VirtualCamera.dylib inside MockMyCam.app.

The rest of MockMyCam is licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see the
repository-root LICENSE and NOTICE files).
